OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud across the region with rain in
OL,7,Fthe north but clear spells elsewhere
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Clouding over
OL,9,Fwith further patchy rain developing by
OL,10,Fdawn for many areas. Breezy initially
OL,11,Fand feeling cool and damp.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAn overcast day with patchy
OL,14,Frain across the region. Rain will be
OL,15,Fmostly drizzly initially but heavier
OL,16,Fbursts are likely to develop later.
OL,17,FLight winds but feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
