OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain gradually clears to leave a drier
OL,7,Fend to Thursday. Largely dry Friday
OL,8,Fand Saturday but a chance of coastal
OL,9,Fshowers. Temperatures below normal.
OL,10,FMostly light winds.
